      A    20.01124000     0.00000000     0.00000000
      B     0.00000000    20.01124000     0.00000000
      C     0.00000000     0.00000000    20.01124000
      PERIODIC NONE #Direction(s) of applied PBC (geometry aspect)
    &END CELL
